^{:go/end 72} (go/func customCompare "customCompare is the compare function of two custom blocks of the same kind (the second result\nreports a compare function that is NULL: an abstract value); compare_unordered is never set by\nthe custom operations of the runtime.\n" [^Value v1 ^Value v2] :results [int bool]
