^{:go/end 95} (go/func compareFloatsU "compareFloatsU orders two floats as compare.c does: a result and whether the comparison ends\n(false: equal, or both NaN in total mode).\n" [^float64 d1 ^float64 d2 ^bool total] :results [int bool]
